3M-february-2018.txt, the 10x Genomics 3' barcode list

6,794,880 cell barcodes, one barcode a line, 115,512,960 bytes, SHA-256
843a6f7038db8cb3c06f3dc21cc69d04139ffa10689780518d7a9e42dc2e819b.

Source. The list was extracted from the `barcodes` dataset of pbmc_1k_v3_molecule_info.h5, a file of the dataset
pbmc_1k_v3 (1k PBMCs from a healthy donor, Chromium v3 chemistry, Cell Ranger 3.0.0) that 10x Genomics created:
https://cf.10xgenomics.com/samples/cell-exp/3.0.0/pbmc_1k_v3/pbmc_1k_v3_molecule_info.h5

