Changes made. The `barcodes` dataset was read from the file and written as text, one barcode a line. 10x Genomics made no
change and does not endorse this use. CC BY 4.0 licenses no trademark.

LGE ships this list only in the Linux tool image it builds for CHTC. It is in no repository and in no app.
